  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Patrician Brothers PROJECT: Project aims to renovate Kwetu Home of Peace (KHP) in Nairobi, Kenya is a rehabilitation centre for street-connected boys aged between 8 and 14 years. The centre offers shelter, education, psychosocial support, and reintegration services to vulnerable children from the streets of Nairobi.   This project will specifically restore the fire damaged kitchen structure so as the centre can continue to provide services.</narrative>
  </description>
